# A small marketing site — a whole page, end to end.
#
#   page
#     header  (logo, navigation)
#     main    -> act one: the hero banner, then three framed cards
#     work    -> act two: its own heading, then three unframed columns
#     section -> one button
#     footer
#
# Everything here is dictionary vocabulary: every kind, every property,
# every containment pair. Nothing in this file says how anything looks, and
# nothing in it is a number. Space, frames, corner radii, alignment and the
# row layout all come from the defaults the dictionary already declares for
# each kind — and the few lines that do write something are written in the
# dictionary's own words (`compact`, `none`, `comfortable`).

make page
page title "Northwind Studio"

make header
header inside page

make brand logo
brand text "Northwind"
brand inside header

make nav navigation
nav text "Work, Studio, Notes"
nav link-spacing "wide"
nav inside header

# --- act one: what we do -----------------------------------------------

make main container
main inside page

make intro banner
intro title "We build calm software."
intro text "Small tools that do one thing properly, then get out of the way."
intro inside main

make features card-group
features inside main

make f1 card
make f2 card
make f3 card
group feature-set = f1 f2 f3
feature-set inside features

f1 title "Fewer moving parts"
f1 text "Every feature we ship removes work rather than adding it."

f2 title "Quiet by default"
f2 text "No notifications, no dashboards, no numbers nobody reads."

f3 title "Yours to leave"
f3 text "Plain files and open formats. Your work outlives the tool."

# --- act two: how we work ----------------------------------------------
#
# The same three-column shape, deliberately not the same object. Act one is
# three things we make, so they are framed. Act two is three steps in one
# way of working, so the frames come off and the space tightens. That
# contrast between the two rows is the whole of what separates them, and it
# is stated in three lines rather than drawn.

make work container
work inside page

make ethos banner
ethos title "How we work"
ethos padding "comfortable"
ethos inside work

make approach card-group
approach inside work

make a1 card
make a2 card
make a3 card
group approach-set = a1 a2 a3
approach-set inside approach

approach-set padding "compact"
approach-set corner-radius "none"
approach-set border "none"

a1 title "We start small"
a1 text "A week of work, and then we look at it together."

a2 title "We stay in the open"
a2 text "Every decision is written down where you can read it."

a3 title "We finish"
a3 text "Shipping beats polishing, so we ship."

# --- the one call to action --------------------------------------------

make cta section
cta inside page

make action button
action text "Start a project"
action inside cta

make footer
footer text "Northwind Studio"
footer inside page

say page title
